(Completely voluntary – no features are blocked): (Gu tur saor-thoileach - chan eil feartan air am bacadh)
(No description): (Gun tuairisgeul)
• Add / rename / delete groups.: • Cuir ris / ath-ainmich / cuir às do bhuidhnean.
• Buffer slider: adjust HLS buffer (1‑10 seconds).: • Sleamhnag bufair: atharraich bufair HLS (1-10 diogan).
• Check URL availability (only visible channels).: • Thoir sùil air na tha ri fhaighinn de URL (seanailean faicsinneach a-mhàin).
• Edit channel names, groups, URLs, logos, tvg-id, country, languages, favorites.: • Deasaich ainmean seanail, buidhnean, URLan, suaicheantasan, tvg-id, dùthaich, cànanan, roghainnean.
• Edit multiple URLs per channel (popup window).: • Deasaich ioma URLan gach sianal (popup uinneag).
• Enrich with EPG: adds missing tvg-id using fuzzy matching.: • Dèan beairteas le EPG: cuir ris tvg-id a tha a dhìth a’ cleachdadh maidseadh fuzzy.
• EPG info displayed in status bar for current channel.: • EPG info air a thaisbeanadh ann an inbhe bar airson làithreach sianal.
• Export OK / FAIL / filtered lists as M3U or JSON.: • Às-mhalairt liostaichean OK / FAIL / sìoltachain mar M3U no JSON.
• Fetch logos from remote repository (OwnerPlugins/logos).: • Faigh suaicheantasan bho ionad-tasgaidh iomallach (OwnerPlugins/suaicheantasan).
• Fullscreen UI: hides sidebar and status bar (ESC to exit).: • UI làn-sgrìn: a’ falach bàr-taoibh is bàr inbhe (ESC gus fàgail).
• Hide/Show channel list button.: • Falaich / Seall putan liosta seanail.
• Import JSON (local or URL) with flexible field mapping (auto-detect, save mapping).: • Import JSON (ionadail no URL) le sùbailte mapadh achadh (fèin-lorg, a shàbhaladh mapadh).
• Picture‑in‑Picture (PIP) button.: • Putan Dealbh-ann-Dealbh (PIP).
• Playback speed: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttons.: • Astar ath-chluich: putanan 0.5x, 1x, 2x.
• Sort any column by clicking header; use 'Reset Order' to revert to original order.: • Deasaich colbh sam bith le bhith a' briogadh air bann-cinn; cleachd ‘Reset Order’ gus tilleadh chun òrdugh tùsail.
• Timeshift: pause live stream; drag slider to seek back; press 'Live' to return.: • Gluasad ùine: stad air an t-sruth bheò; slaod sleamhnachan a shireadh air ais; brùth 'Live' gus tilleadh.
◀ Previous: ◀ Roimhe
16 colour themes + Light/Dark variants.: 16 cuspairean dath + caochlaidhean aotrom / dorcha.
A new version is available. Do you want to update now?: Tha dreach ùr ri fhaighinn. A bheil thu airson ùrachadh a-nis?
